config HWINFO_BCM2835
	bool "BCM283x device ID via VideoCore firmware"
	default y
	depends on SOC_BCM2710
	depends on BCM2835_FIRMWARE
	select HWINFO_HAS_DRIVER
	help
	  Implement hwinfo_get_device_id() by issuing the GET_BOARD_SERIAL
	  property tag (0x00010004) to the VideoCore firmware. Returns
	  the 8-byte OTP serial number every Pi has burned in at factory.
	  Used by the USB device stack to fill the iSerialNumber string
	  descriptor, by MCUboot for device-unique entropy, etc.

	  Pulls in CONFIG_BCM2835_FIRMWARE (and therefore CONFIG_BCM2835_MBOX
	  and CONFIG_CACHE_MANAGEMENT) as dependencies.
